(1253381, 160461, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels a bit over processed and over sharpened to me. Otherwise nice composition. Not knowing who Robert Smith is, leads me to seeing this largely as an abstract.</td>', 'Feels a bit over processed and over sharpened to me. Otherwise nice composition. Not knowing who Robert Smith is, leads me to seeing this largely as an abstract.', '2005-03-28 01:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
