(1253397, 160272, 18197, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the dead on composition of this is as effective as other angles might have been. Grass seems washed out (probably close to reality of winter damaged grass) but as a result, the photo doesn''t draw me in and demand my attention.</td>', 'I don''t think the dead on composition of this is as effective as other angles might have been. Grass seems washed out (probably close to reality of winter damaged grass) but as a result, the photo doesn''t draw me in and demand my attention.', '2005-03-28 02:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253400, 159388, 18197, '<td valign="top">Too busy. Focus issues. Saturation and lighting issues.</td>', 'Too busy. Focus issues. Saturation and lighting issues.', '2005-03-28 02:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
