(1253422, 160562, 31307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!  I really like how it''s spooky yet beautiful.  I think this will do pretty well in the competition!  (Maybe even place in the top three?  I wouldn''t be surprised).</td>', 'Beautiful colors!  I really like how it''s spooky yet beautiful.  I think this will do pretty well in the competition!  (Maybe even place in the top three?  I wouldn''t be surprised).', '2005-03-28 02:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
