(1253424, 160308, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lives up to its title. Stark arresting image. Interesting textures. I like the comp. Monochrome works well.</td>', 'Lives up to its title. Stark arresting image. Interesting textures. I like the comp. Monochrome works well.', '2005-03-28 02:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
