(1253436, 159796, 6668, '<td valign="top">The writing on top that is cut off is distracting to me, possibly could have been cloned out?</td>', 'The writing on top that is cut off is distracting to me, possibly could have been cloned out?', '2005-03-28 02:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
