(1253446, 159914, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wow! From the thumbnail, I didn''t expect to like this one, but full size, it is terrific. Some may criticize for being too dark, but it feels just right to me. Congratulations on a great capture.</td>', 'Wow! From the thumbnail, I didn''t expect to like this one, but full size, it is terrific. Some may criticize for being too dark, but it feels just right to me. Congratulations on a great capture.', '2005-03-28 02:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
