(1253689, 160519, 15810, '<td valign="top">Emotive shot and intelligent composition. Personally I dont like "staged" shots and this does look a bit "wooden"</td>', 'Emotive shot and intelligent composition. Personally I dont like "staged" shots and this does look a bit "wooden"', '2005-03-28 07:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253690, 160352, 15810, '<td valign="top">The two colour figures make for an interestng focal point and give the snse of searching through the vast graveyard for the grave in question. Personally I think you could have achieved the same "message" by getting in a bit closer and making more of the figures. Nice message though.</td>', 'The two colour figures make for an interestng focal point and give the snse of searching through the vast graveyard for the grave in question. Personally I think you could have achieved the same "message" by getting in a bit closer and making more of the figures. Nice message though.', '2005-03-28 07:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253691, 160012, 15810, '<td valign="top">great sky and lovely exposure.</td>', 'great sky and lovely exposure.', '2005-03-28 07:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253692, 160329, 15810, '<td valign="top">Beautifully crisp and great B&amp;W tones. Love the shadows of the trees. Great shot.</td>', 'Beautifully crisp and great B&W tones. Love the shadows of the trees. Great shot.', '2005-03-28 07:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253693, 160328, 32602, '<td valign="top">Oooh. Creepy.</td>', 'Oooh. Creepy.', '2005-03-28 07:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253697, 160440, 15810, '<td valign="top">Just read the sory on NAT (Nordic Adventure Travel). Well done for submitting something different but this close crop doesnt really show me the "Final Resting Place" of the British Trawler. If the beach cove is as beautiful as it sounds why not step back a bit and show the wreckage in it''s surroundings?</td>', 'Just read the sory on NAT (Nordic Adventure Travel). Well done for submitting something different but this close crop doesnt really show me the "Final Resting Place" of the British Trawler. If the beach cove is as beautiful as it sounds why not step back a bit and show the wreckage in it''s surroundings?', '2005-03-28 07:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253698, 160225, 15810, '<td valign="top">Strange crop. I''m not sure that the tree on the left helps your composition at all? Makes the photo seem a bit unbalanced. The deep DOF also flattens the two rows of  relatively uninteresting gravestones together,  exactly the wrong effect for this shot IMO.</td>', 'Strange crop. I''m not sure that the tree on the left helps your composition at all? Makes the photo seem a bit unbalanced. The deep DOF also flattens the two rows of  relatively uninteresting gravestones together,  exactly the wrong effect for this shot IMO.', '2005-03-28 07:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253700, 160439, 3306, '<td valign="top">This would have been a winner in this challenge if you had the tombstones writing visible with the reflection. Very good</td>', 'This would have been a winner in this challenge if you had the tombstones writing visible with the reflection. Very good', '2005-03-28 07:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253701, 159244, 15810, '<td valign="top">"Neglected"? the stones look "Vandalised". What is the red on these stones?. Nice colours and DOF but a portrait framing may have showed more of the stones and improved the shot.</td>', '"Neglected"? the stones look "Vandalised". What is the red on these stones?. Nice colours and DOF but a portrait framing may have showed more of the stones and improved the shot.', '2005-03-28 08:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253706, 158921, 33379, '<td valign="top">looks like the cross has light around...hmmmm spooky!</td>', 'looks like the cross has light around...hmmmm spooky!', '2005-03-28 08:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253709, 158876, 33379, '<td valign="top">shouldve focused on the headstone wouldve made it better</td>', 'shouldve focused on the headstone wouldve made it better', '2005-03-28 08:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
