(1253725, 160371, 30959, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - as a rule I do not get to wrapped around the axle on borders. The colors on this one are a bit unsettling, no loss of points, just a thought.</td>', 'Nice photo - as a rule I do not get to wrapped around the axle on borders. The colors on this one are a bit unsettling, no loss of points, just a thought.', '2005-03-28 08:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253731, 159755, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I love the dramatism in the sky and the lighting used on the tumbstone.</td>', 'Great capture! I love the dramatism in the sky and the lighting used on the tumbstone.', '2005-03-28 08:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253733, 159756, 30959, '<td valign="top">I like this setup, however I would have moved closer to the stone so it dominated as opposed to the tree. The picture at this point seems to be about the tree, the light draws my eyes to the branch and then right to the colors, and I have to force a return to the stone. Good setting and idea, like the colors. 6</td>', 'I like this setup, however I would have moved closer to the stone so it dominated as opposed to the tree. The picture at this point seems to be about the tree, the light draws my eyes to the branch and then right to the colors, and I have to force a return to the stone. Good setting and idea, like the colors. 6', '2005-03-28 08:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253739, 160528, 30018, '<td valign="top">I spend a lot of time in Cemetaries, and have always wondered what the signicance of the log grave markers is.  Can anyone shed some light on this?  This photo is a good capture of the log stones.  Nicely done &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'I spend a lot of time in Cemetaries, and have always wondered what the signicance of the log grave markers is.  Can anyone shed some light on this?  This photo is a good capture of the log stones.  Nicely done <6>', '2005-03-28 08:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253744, 158636, 33546, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Nice comosition. Too beautiful to be set in such a creepy setting, makes it a bit disturbing.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Nice comosition. Too beautiful to be set in such a creepy setting, makes it a bit disturbing.', '2005-03-28 08:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
