(1253839, 159919, 33560, '<td valign="top">Title is a bit ironic given the person standing &amp; remembering.  Lack of contrast hurts this photo. So does the fact that nothing seems to be in focus.</td>', 'Title is a bit ironic given the person standing & remembering.  Lack of contrast hurts this photo. So does the fact that nothing seems to be in focus.', '2005-03-28 10:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
