(1253845, 160611, 33361, '<td valign="top">very nice 7</td>', 'very nice 7', '2005-03-28 10:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253848, 159011, 33560, '<td valign="top">As the picture formed on my screen I held my breath, for I love Spanish moss.  I''m afraid I was disappointed with what lay below.  The monuments seem a little jumbled and indistinct.  It looks like they might look good taken individually with their own backgrounds, but it strikes me as a bit of a jumbled composition.</td>', 'As the picture formed on my screen I held my breath, for I love Spanish moss.  I''m afraid I was disappointed with what lay below.  The monuments seem a little jumbled and indistinct.  It looks like they might look good taken individually with their own backgrounds, but it strikes me as a bit of a jumbled composition.', '2005-03-28 10:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253849, 160461, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sometimes cranking up the saturation works.  I love the textures and colors.  Nice, simple, strong composition.</td>', 'Sometimes cranking up the saturation works.  I love the textures and colors.  Nice, simple, strong composition.', '2005-03-28 10:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253850, 159621, 33560, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2005-03-28 10:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253855, 159148, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice choice in DOF.  I like missing body parts like this (head/limbs etc.) because it adds more to the picture or at least in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice choice in DOF.  I like missing body parts like this (head/limbs etc.) because it adds more to the picture or at least in my opinion.', '2005-03-28 10:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253857, 160377, 33560, '<td valign="top">First impression: the lighing here is exquisite.  Second impression; burning and dodging seems a bit too obvious for my taste I''m sitting here thinking about it rather than the photo.</td>', 'First impression: the lighing here is exquisite.  Second impression; burning and dodging seems a bit too obvious for my taste I''m sitting here thinking about it rather than the photo.', '2005-03-28 10:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253866, 160548, 33560, '<td valign="top">Understanding that it is an insect ''cemetary'' somehow does not redeem the photo.  It would have been better if a few more strands of the web were in crisp focus and if the subject were not so close to the center of the frame.  One well photographed spider is infinitely better than two and a half less well photographed ones. The colors seem a little wierd, it might  have looked better in B&amp;W.  The contrast seems a little low; it looks like there may not be any fully white pixels.</td>', 'Understanding that it is an insect ''cemetary'' somehow does not redeem the photo.  It would have been better if a few more strands of the web were in crisp focus and if the subject were not so close to the center of the frame.  One well photographed spider is infinitely better than two and a half less well photographed ones. The colors seem a little wierd, it might  have looked better in B&W.  The contrast seems a little low; it looks like there may not be any fully white pixels.', '2005-03-28 10:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1253867, 160272, 33361, '<td valign="top">only complaint is the dark shadow across the back headstone on the left</td>', 'only complaint is the dark shadow across the back headstone on the left', '2005-03-28 10:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
