(1254183, 160499, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like your base image, but your dodging and burning is very uneven.  this might be a good time (and a good image) to revisit your post processing and work on it until you are able to produce the images you are after.  if you want some tips, let me know.</td>', 'i like your base image, but your dodging and burning is very uneven.  this might be a good time (and a good image) to revisit your post processing and work on it until you are able to produce the images you are after.  if you want some tips, let me know.', '2005-03-28 13:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1254184, 160329, 33629, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast, symmetry and feel of this.</td>', 'I love the contrast, symmetry and feel of this.', '2005-03-28 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1254186, 159376, 35021, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition!  I only wish it was cropped a little differently because it has a sloping feel to it.  I really like the concept and use of black &amp; white.</td>', 'Very nice composition!  I only wish it was cropped a little differently because it has a sloping feel to it.  I really like the concept and use of black & white.', '2005-03-28 13:16:49.000000', NULL, 1);
