(1254204, 158703, 35021, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition and tone.  I only wish the foreground and cross were more in focus or sharper.  I am not sure if it''s just the resolution or how the picture actually is.</td>', 'I really like your composition and tone.  I only wish the foreground and cross were more in focus or sharper.  I am not sure if it''s just the resolution or how the picture actually is.', '2005-03-28 13:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
