(1254218, 160523, 18219, '<td valign="top">A good overall picture, but personally I don''t like the colored tuips.<br/>The tombstones look a little dark too.<br/>The background of mountains is great as are the clouds.</td>', 'A good overall picture, but personally I don''t like the colored tuips.The tombstones look a little dark too.The background of mountains is great as are the clouds.', '2005-03-28 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
