(1254248, 160617, 35021, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in the sky.  The stone doesn''t look as sharp as it could be and it has an odd color cast.  Was it really this color?  I think you may have done better with a more interesting headstone and not cropping it as tightly.</td>', 'I really like the colors in the sky.  The stone doesn''t look as sharp as it could be and it has an odd color cast.  Was it really this color?  I think you may have done better with a more interesting headstone and not cropping it as tightly.', '2005-03-28 13:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
