(1254382, 160437, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great shot-the only problem is that the trees are barren, and the ground absent of leaves making the set-up a little too obvious..I like it anyway.</td>', 'Great shot-the only problem is that the trees are barren, and the ground absent of leaves making the set-up a little too obvious..I like it anyway.', '2005-03-28 14:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
