(1254385, 160300, 35021, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and tone.  I do not exactly know why, but the composition looks a little off for me.  Also, I do not really understand how this picture fits in the "cemetary" category, except that maybe you found this statue in the cemetary.  Otherwise I think it is a nice photo  =)</td>', 'I really like the color and tone.  I do not exactly know why, but the composition looks a little off for me.  Also, I do not really understand how this picture fits in the "cemetary" category, except that maybe you found this statue in the cemetary.  Otherwise I think it is a nice photo  =)', '2005-03-28 14:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1254386, 160544, 35021, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the cemetery challenge  =)  Did you use diffuse glow?  If, you did, I think it was a little over-done.  Also, the light area in the lower left corner is very distracting.  I would have cloned that out or recropped.  Otherwise, I like your composition and your perspective of the challange.</td>', 'A nice take on the cemetery challenge  =)  Did you use diffuse glow?  If, you did, I think it was a little over-done.  Also, the light area in the lower left corner is very distracting.  I would have cloned that out or recropped.  Otherwise, I like your composition and your perspective of the challange.', '2005-03-28 14:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
