(1254405, 160474, 11897, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sharp picture, love the sky.<br/>Maybe the dodging on the building is just a little overdone but that is just a nitpick.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful sharp picture, love the sky.Maybe the dodging on the building is just a little overdone but that is just a nitpick.Good luck.', '2005-03-28 15:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
