(1254621, 160602, 811, '<td valign="top">This looks really pixelated to me.  When I look at the properties of the site, it may be jpeg compression artifacts.  After the challenge, ask in the forums how resize so that this doesn''t happen (assuming, of course, you did not mean for it to do this.  If you did, myapologies, and ignore the aforementioned advise)</td>', 'This looks really pixelated to me.  When I look at the properties of the site, it may be jpeg compression artifacts.  After the challenge, ask in the forums how resize so that this doesn''t happen (assuming, of course, you did not mean for it to do this.  If you did, myapologies, and ignore the aforementioned advise)', '2005-03-28 17:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
