(1255487, 159513, 17937, '<td valign="top">wow.  this looks really old.  This would really make a creepy photo if it was taken at night or even made darker in photoshop...</td>', 'wow.  this looks really old.  This would really make a creepy photo if it was taken at night or even made darker in photoshop...', '2005-03-28 23:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
