(1255544, 160377, 34985, '<td valign="top">Very Very nice, love the sky in the background and the colors of the grass, nice capture of color!</td>', 'Very Very nice, love the sky in the background and the colors of the grass, nice capture of color!', '2005-03-28 23:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255556, 159231, 34985, '<td valign="top">I can''t make this out?? is it just me??</td>', 'I can''t make this out?? is it just me??', '2005-03-28 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255564, 160455, 34985, '<td valign="top">this is a great photo!!!!! 10</td>', 'this is a great photo!!!!! 10', '2005-03-29 00:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255568, 160065, 32997, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, would be better without the car there.</td>', 'Nice shot, would be better without the car there.', '2005-03-29 00:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255579, 160497, 11895, '<td valign="top">doesn''t look natural at all, looks like way too much d&amp;b to me</td>', 'doesn''t look natural at all, looks like way too much d&b to me', '2005-03-29 00:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255590, 158703, 33112, '<td valign="top">I like that the brightest part of the sky is behind the crucifix...i''m trying to decide if I would have cropped out the column on the left or not....nice tonality, although my personal preference would be for the blacks to be just a tiny bit blacker. 7</td>', 'I like that the brightest part of the sky is behind the crucifix...i''m trying to decide if I would have cropped out the column on the left or not....nice tonality, although my personal preference would be for the blacks to be just a tiny bit blacker. 7', '2005-03-29 00:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255596, 160271, 33112, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the snow...it''s tough to get that without losing the shadows....the sticks are distracting, i think....and I''m not crazy about the sky.  I''d rather see a higher pov that focuses just on the stones against the snow.  5</td>', 'I like the texture of the snow...it''s tough to get that without losing the shadows....the sticks are distracting, i think....and I''m not crazy about the sky.  I''d rather see a higher pov that focuses just on the stones against the snow.  5', '2005-03-29 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255600, 159231, 34446, '<td valign="top">beautiful...</td>', 'beautiful...', '2005-03-29 00:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255612, 159172, 33112, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you did to the sky, but the saturation seems odd.  I dig the composition, though, and the contrast in brightness between the sky and the building.  5</td>', 'I''m not sure what you did to the sky, but the saturation seems odd.  I dig the composition, though, and the contrast in brightness between the sky and the building.  5', '2005-03-29 00:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255618, 159011, 33112, '<td valign="top">Love the textures....I just wish there was a more prominent subject.  I think the stone on the right is a little too close to the edge.  Hope you don''t get in trouble for your border....I think it''s not supposed to be gradiated like that.  (not reporting you or anything....just for future reference)</td>', 'Love the textures....I just wish there was a more prominent subject.  I think the stone on the right is a little too close to the edge.  Hope you don''t get in trouble for your border....I think it''s not supposed to be gradiated like that.  (not reporting you or anything....just for future reference)', '2005-03-29 00:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255620, 159332, 33112, '<td valign="top">excellent...nice detail</td>', 'excellent...nice detail', '2005-03-29 00:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255623, 158728, 32997, '<td valign="top">Very clean..like that it is in colour and still natural looking.</td>', 'Very clean..like that it is in colour and still natural looking.', '2005-03-29 00:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255624, 158801, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...a vey powerful image.</td>', 'Nicely done...a vey powerful image.', '2005-03-29 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255631, 160305, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great crop!</td>', 'Great crop!', '2005-03-29 00:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255643, 160533, 8953, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the contest:)</td>', 'This is my favorite of the contest:)', '2005-03-29 00:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255670, 160430, 25468, '<td valign="top">I like the vivid color of the flowers and the tree, but am thrown off by the one little limb that covers some of the praying hands.. I think if it were not there I would have scored higher.</td>', 'I like the vivid color of the flowers and the tree, but am thrown off by the one little limb that covers some of the praying hands.. I think if it were not there I would have scored higher.', '2005-03-29 01:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255672, 160440, 25468, '<td valign="top">Great Bokeh, Sharp subject. but IMHO way off the subject. Just didn''t feel this interpretation. 5</td>', 'Great Bokeh, Sharp subject. but IMHO way off the subject. Just didn''t feel this interpretation. 5', '2005-03-29 01:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255673, 159717, 25468, '<td valign="top">I had this same sort of idea. This seems odly like some path towards death. Pretty creepy.</td>', 'I had this same sort of idea. This seems odly like some path towards death. Pretty creepy.', '2005-03-29 01:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255675, 159756, 25468, '<td valign="top">I like everything but the ''ghost''. Seems more annoying than helpful. That said I really like the rest of the photo. Had it not had the brutal flare, would have gone in favorites. 5</td>', 'I like everything but the ''ghost''. Seems more annoying than helpful. That said I really like the rest of the photo. Had it not had the brutal flare, would have gone in favorites. 5', '2005-03-29 01:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255676, 160535, 25468, '<td valign="top">Not liking the strong glare from the top of the tombstone. Sort of distracting. Also the image seems a little ''soft'', not sure if you meant that.</td>', 'Not liking the strong glare from the top of the tombstone. Sort of distracting. Also the image seems a little ''soft'', not sure if you meant that.', '2005-03-29 01:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255678, 160353, 25468, '<td valign="top">This seems like something I would have entered myself, but couldn''t find anything that fit THIS idea. I personally like the emphasis on the cathedral. I have a great way to get the dodged/burned look without doing so. If you''re interested email me after the challenge.</td>', 'This seems like something I would have entered myself, but couldn''t find anything that fit THIS idea. I personally like the emphasis on the cathedral. I have a great way to get the dodged/burned look without doing so. If you''re interested email me after the challenge.', '2005-03-29 01:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255679, 159172, 25468, '<td valign="top">I like the way the sky looks but that''s about it for this shot. I not a fan of this choice in cropping, seems more slogan oriented than ''cemetary''.</td>', 'I like the way the sky looks but that''s about it for this shot. I not a fan of this choice in cropping, seems more slogan oriented than ''cemetary''.', '2005-03-29 01:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255682, 160368, 25468, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of colors. Definately original. This photo seems very hellish and creepy which is great if you ask me. 6</td>', 'Interesting choice of colors. Definately original. This photo seems very hellish and creepy which is great if you ask me. 6', '2005-03-29 01:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255684, 160078, 25468, '<td valign="top">Very military like. I''m liking the idea, get sort of an ''army of darkness'' vibe. Great job</td>', 'Very military like. I''m liking the idea, get sort of an ''army of darkness'' vibe. Great job', '2005-03-29 01:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255686, 160455, 25468, '<td valign="top">Great shot. My favorite so far. The sky is awesome, the tree adds loads to composition. Love the angle, awesome work.</td>', 'Great shot. My favorite so far. The sky is awesome, the tree adds loads to composition. Love the angle, awesome work.', '2005-03-29 01:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255689, 160620, 25468, '<td valign="top">I am really sad that this photo is crooked. Really killed it for me. Sorry.</td>', 'I am really sad that this photo is crooked. Really killed it for me. Sorry.', '2005-03-29 01:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255704, 160377, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Great colors, levels, focus, comp. Sky looks a little "off.'' Might be trying to hard with it in post processing.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Great colors, levels, focus, comp. Sky looks a little "off.'' Might be trying to hard with it in post processing.', '2005-03-29 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255705, 160455, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like many things about this image. The angle and POV give the headstones a larger than life feeling, and I guess death is larger than life. Composition, focus, desaturation are all virtually perfect. This could be a ribbon contender.</td>', 'I like many things about this image. The angle and POV give the headstones a larger than life feeling, and I guess death is larger than life. Composition, focus, desaturation are all virtually perfect. This could be a ribbon contender.', '2005-03-29 01:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255708, 158899, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. What a great subject and what a terrific capture. Focus is beautifully sharp. Contrast and levels are very nice. Colors work great. This feels like a ribbon contender to me. Good luck.</td>', 'This is fantastic. What a great subject and what a terrific capture. Focus is beautifully sharp. Contrast and levels are very nice. Colors work great. This feels like a ribbon contender to me. Good luck.', '2005-03-29 01:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255712, 160439, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really like a photographer that takes risks. THIS was worth the risk. Congratulations on a great photo!</td>', 'I really like a photographer that takes risks. THIS was worth the risk. Congratulations on a great photo!', '2005-03-29 02:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255714, 160271, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiffuly captured and processed. May be a ribbon winner here.</td>', 'Beautiffuly captured and processed. May be a ribbon winner here.', '2005-03-29 02:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255715, 159755, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo. I love the colors and especially the color of the stone contrasting with dark background.  Great composition. So far, among the best I''ve seen this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful photo. I love the colors and especially the color of the stone contrasting with dark background.  Great composition. So far, among the best I''ve seen this challenge.', '2005-03-29 02:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255719, 158728, 18197, '<td valign="top">I grew up in a place that looked much like this, Montana USA, where the culture of the old west presided, and boot hill was something real, because people really died with their boots on. I like it a lot and it gave me a real nostalgia trip. Thanks and good luck!</td>', 'I grew up in a place that looked much like this, Montana USA, where the culture of the old west presided, and boot hill was something real, because people really died with their boots on. I like it a lot and it gave me a real nostalgia trip. Thanks and good luck!', '2005-03-29 02:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255722, 160549, 18197, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the spirit of the challenge.', '2005-03-29 02:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255730, 160514, 32602, '<td valign="top">The clarity is nice, the simplicity  is too. I think I would like to see the right hand edge of the sign included in the crop. Good use of the sky through the lettering.</td>', 'The clarity is nice, the simplicity  is too. I think I would like to see the right hand edge of the sign included in the crop. Good use of the sky through the lettering.', '2005-03-29 02:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255766, 158813, 16241, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2005-03-29 04:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255767, 159621, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-03-29 04:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255769, 158703, 16241, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2005-03-29 04:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255770, 159798, 16241, '<td valign="top">was this to get away from the watchful eyes of the wives? 7</td>', 'was this to get away from the watchful eyes of the wives? 7', '2005-03-29 04:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255784, 159876, 33112, '<td valign="top">that is sooooo creepy.  I can''t imagine running into that in a cemetery.  great shot 8</td>', 'that is sooooo creepy.  I can''t imagine running into that in a cemetery.  great shot 8', '2005-03-29 04:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255785, 158636, 33112, '<td valign="top">hmmmmmm.....<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful shot, but I just can''t get over the fact that it seems really disrespectful.</td>', 'hmmmmmm..... It''s a beautiful shot, but I just can''t get over the fact that it seems really disrespectful.', '2005-03-29 04:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255786, 159145, 35322, '<td valign="top">realy nice picture, the black and white touch is great</td>', 'realy nice picture, the black and white touch is great', '2005-03-29 04:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255800, 160499, 32602, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The streaky sky lets it down, cloning out something?</td>', 'I like the composition. The streaky sky lets it down, cloning out something?', '2005-03-29 05:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255805, 158622, 27399, '<td valign="top">Could have done better with the composition.  Such as instead of the wasted space on the left and right and only partial view of the headstone with th writing at the botto, could have turned the camera and shown what the statue was mourning over.  I really like it though.</td>', 'Could have done better with the composition.  Such as instead of the wasted space on the left and right and only partial view of the headstone with th writing at the botto, could have turned the camera and shown what the statue was mourning over.  I really like it though.', '2005-03-29 05:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255812, 160153, 27399, '<td valign="top">This image touches the soul, especially for those who know what it is like to lose a loved one.  It reminds us, also, of what a cemetery is and the faces/lives of those who remain.  Good work.</td>', 'This image touches the soul, especially for those who know what it is like to lose a loved one.  It reminds us, also, of what a cemetery is and the faces/lives of those who remain.  Good work.', '2005-03-29 06:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255813, 160513, 27399, '<td valign="top">It took me a while for this image to jump out at me, even though I saw it several times.  I don''t know why, it''s great!  Reminds me of the Biblical passage about in order to enter the kingdom of God you must become like a child, invoking the image of a child image and how death is kind of a "sleep", as the image portrays.  The several thought/emotions the image invokes, a good title, good techinical aspects (composition, exposure)  . . . 10</td>', 'It took me a while for this image to jump out at me, even though I saw it several times.  I don''t know why, it''s great!  Reminds me of the Biblical passage about in order to enter the kingdom of God you must become like a child, invoking the image of a child image and how death is kind of a "sleep", as the image portrays.  The several thought/emotions the image invokes, a good title, good techinical aspects (composition, exposure)  . . . 10', '2005-03-29 06:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255815, 159973, 27399, '<td valign="top">This image evokes good emotion/sentiment.  Well, good as in clever, eluding to the two different worlds (life and after life) and how we are separated from each other.  Good work.</td>', 'This image evokes good emotion/sentiment.  Well, good as in clever, eluding to the two different worlds (life and after life) and how we are separated from each other.  Good work.', '2005-03-29 06:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255818, 160160, 27399, '<td valign="top">Great selection.  I''m sure you were looking at several images before taking this photo, and it was a good choice.  You took a simple image and made it great.  I like the shadows on the cross and flower, too.</td>', 'Great selection.  I''m sure you were looking at several images before taking this photo, and it was a good choice.  You took a simple image and made it great.  I like the shadows on the cross and flower, too.', '2005-03-29 06:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255822, 159376, 27399, '<td valign="top">First of all, as you have probably seen there are a lot of angel shots in this contest.  Yours is the best of them.  Second, apart from the relativity to other angel shots, this is a great photo.  Good title, too.  I like how the book is only half-full, even though the cemetery is packed.  Reminding us that it is a never ending, continual process (life and death).  This statue will outlive all of us and keep ours, as well as their stories.  9</td>', 'First of all, as you have probably seen there are a lot of angel shots in this contest.  Yours is the best of them.  Second, apart from the relativity to other angel shots, this is a great photo.  Good title, too.  I like how the book is only half-full, even though the cemetery is packed.  Reminding us that it is a never ending, continual process (life and death).  This statue will outlive all of us and keep ours, as well as their stories.  9', '2005-03-29 06:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255823, 160471, 34125, '<td valign="top">all we are is ducks in the wind...</td>', 'all we are is ducks in the wind...', '2005-03-29 06:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255827, 158801, 35530, '<td valign="top">Hauntingly beautiful. One of the nicest shots. I find that if you would have cropped this from half-way up the wall, the photo would be more powerful. Remarkable, none the less.</td>', 'Hauntingly beautiful. One of the nicest shots. I find that if you would have cropped this from half-way up the wall, the photo would be more powerful. Remarkable, none the less.', '2005-03-29 06:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255830, 158588, 35530, '<td valign="top">Super shot and a great analogy.</td>', 'Super shot and a great analogy.', '2005-03-29 06:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255831, 160472, 4281, '<td valign="top">This is a nice statue, that''s for sure but I fail to see any interpretion of the scene on your behalf or you adding any value to the photograph.<br/>E.g. if you could have tried a bit different angle of view and perhaps tried to include some background (a nice vista of the cemetery, the trees or the sky) or perhaps some foreground (maybe a flower or a real little girl?) this picture would be something more than a plain picture of a beautiful statue.<br/>In addition, I don''t like how you have failed to include the whole statue in the photo - the feet are missing.</td>', 'This is a nice statue, that''s for sure but I fail to see any interpretion of the scene on your behalf or you adding any value to the photograph.E.g. if you could have tried a bit different angle of view and perhaps tried to include some background (a nice vista of the cemetery, the trees or the sky) or perhaps some foreground (maybe a flower or a real little girl?) this picture would be something more than a plain picture of a beautiful statue.In addition, I don''t like how you have failed to include the whole statue in the photo - the feet are missing.', '2005-03-29 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255832, 160401, 35530, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...one of the best in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot...one of the best in this challenge.', '2005-03-29 06:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255837, 160307, 35530, '<td valign="top">Awesome. What caused the glow by the headstones? Candles? Superb.</td>', 'Awesome. What caused the glow by the headstones? Candles? Superb.', '2005-03-29 06:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255841, 159481, 31955, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image. Not so sur the selective desat worked on the grass. The stones look like they are floating or were pasted in.  Otherwise a really good photo. Good Luck</td>', 'Very powerful image. Not so sur the selective desat worked on the grass. The stones look like they are floating or were pasted in.  Otherwise a really good photo. Good Luck', '2005-03-29 06:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255842, 159658, 35530, '<td valign="top">You can almost feel the wet chill in the air. Excellent.</td>', 'You can almost feel the wet chill in the air. Excellent.', '2005-03-29 06:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
