(1256896, 158428, 33515, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge, the detail in the iron and use of DOF is nice<br/></td>', 'Good take on the challenge, the detail in the iron and use of DOF is nice', '2005-03-29 18:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1256900, 159762, 33515, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture with the falling flowers.</td>', 'Beautiful picture with the falling flowers.', '2005-03-29 18:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1256946, 159143, 6668, '<td valign="top">very nice, I like the coloring it adds a mystical feel to it.  Good luck.</td>', 'very nice, I like the coloring it adds a mystical feel to it.  Good luck.', '2005-03-29 18:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1256948, 160241, 6668, '<td valign="top">What a touching photo, very nice.</td>', 'What a touching photo, very nice.', '2005-03-29 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1256998, 160437, 12578, '<td valign="top">great use of selective colour</td>', 'great use of selective colour', '2005-03-29 19:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257001, 160497, 12578, '<td valign="top">unsure if you have gone down the burning and dodging route but it seems a little over-exposed and a little under-exposed in general, its just shouting out to me too dark and too bright. The Cemetery text on the gate is a great capture none the less and a well eyed up composition but the horizon looks like a slight tilt to the left could really help out. good job. :0)</td>', 'unsure if you have gone down the burning and dodging route but it seems a little over-exposed and a little under-exposed in general, its just shouting out to me too dark and too bright. The Cemetery text on the gate is a great capture none the less and a well eyed up composition but the horizon looks like a slight tilt to the left could really help out. good job. :0)', '2005-03-29 19:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257009, 160534, 32602, '<td valign="top">One of the best  imo. Cropping a bit tight at top. Good colour, clarity and nice dof.</td>', 'One of the best  imo. Cropping a bit tight at top. Good colour, clarity and nice dof.', '2005-03-29 19:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257012, 160353, 32602, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, just a little too dark in foreground.</td>', 'Lovely composition, just a little too dark in foreground.', '2005-03-29 19:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257020, 160606, 32602, '<td valign="top">I feel this needs to be leveled (about 0.6 ccw). I don''t care for the darkening edges, especially at the bottom. The central statue draws the eye anyway so it is unnecessary. The colour and light is good. I do like the photo, but think it could be better and this is just my opinion after all.</td>', 'I feel this needs to be leveled (about 0.6 ccw). I don''t care for the darkening edges, especially at the bottom. The central statue draws the eye anyway so it is unnecessary. The colour and light is good. I do like the photo, but think it could be better and this is just my opinion after all.', '2005-03-29 20:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257022, 160172, 6668, '<td valign="top">The tree in the front on the right hand side takes away from the image in my opinion.</td>', 'The tree in the front on the right hand side takes away from the image in my opinion.', '2005-03-29 20:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257031, 159229, 32774, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be a picture from heidi, I guess I''ll have to wait and see.  If this is her picture, I love the skies in your pictures.  If it''s not, I love the sky in this picture.  Very well shot, good perspecive, leading lines keep your eyes on the photo.  This should ribbon.<br/> <br/>-Frank</td>', 'This looks like it could be a picture from heidi, I guess I''ll have to wait and see.  If this is her picture, I love the skies in your pictures.  If it''s not, I love the sky in this picture.  Very well shot, good perspecive, leading lines keep your eyes on the photo.  This should ribbon. -Frank', '2005-03-29 20:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257033, 160548, 32774, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro shot, I hate spiders, all well, it''s still a good shot.  I would''ve put the spider so it wasn''t in the middle though.<br/> <br/>-Frank</td>', 'Nice Macro shot, I hate spiders, all well, it''s still a good shot.  I would''ve put the spider so it wasn''t in the middle though. -Frank', '2005-03-29 20:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257038, 160620, 32774, '<td valign="top">Horizon is a little slanted, pretty sky, slow shutter''s are great.<br/> <br/>-Frank</td>', 'Horizon is a little slanted, pretty sky, slow shutter''s are great. -Frank', '2005-03-29 20:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257044, 160470, 32774, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t cut down those trees with a chainsaw, I would''ve liked to see the sky open.  Still one of the most powerful and well shot pictures in the challenge.  Good score from me.  Oh, and great placement of the angel.<br/> <br/>-Frank</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t cut down those trees with a chainsaw, I would''ve liked to see the sky open.  Still one of the most powerful and well shot pictures in the challenge.  Good score from me.  Oh, and great placement of the angel. -Frank', '2005-03-29 20:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257051, 159919, 32602, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of colour. Near the girl''s foot there is a blown out patch? Can''t see what it is, but if you have PS it should have been cloned out.</td>', 'Excellent use of colour. Near the girl''s foot there is a blown out patch? Can''t see what it is, but if you have PS it should have been cloned out.', '2005-03-29 20:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
