(1258190, 159324, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is so over-the-top sappy/sentimental I have to score it well. It''s just about the epitome of kitsch. And it''s nicely framed and all that stuff too.</td>', 'This is so over-the-top sappy/sentimental I have to score it well. It''s just about the epitome of kitsch. And it''s nicely framed and all that stuff too.', '2005-03-30 04:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258193, 160513, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The fringe of frost is an exquisite detail. One of the most original and best-seen images in a challenge filled with  the ''expected".</td>', 'This is beautiful. The fringe of frost is an exquisite detail. One of the most original and best-seen images in a challenge filled with  the ''expected".', '2005-03-30 04:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258195, 158801, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is utterly spectacular. Even the unfortunately tight cropping right an bottom can''t do much damage.</td>', 'This is utterly spectacular. Even the unfortunately tight cropping right an bottom can''t do much damage.', '2005-03-30 04:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258198, 160012, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sumptuous and lovely. I really appreciate the skillful hint of "place" that appends to the ethnic carvings.</td>', 'Sumptuous and lovely. I really appreciate the skillful hint of "place" that appends to the ethnic carvings.', '2005-03-30 04:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258199, 160296, 30861, '<td valign="top">A completely different image in a challenge filled with sameness. I like it very much and hope it does well, though I suspect it won''t. The white slats in front may be a little TOO bright, but not by a lot.</td>', 'A completely different image in a challenge filled with sameness. I like it very much and hope it does well, though I suspect it won''t. The white slats in front may be a little TOO bright, but not by a lot.', '2005-03-30 04:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258203, 160486, 30861, '<td valign="top">In my mind this lovely image suffers from too tight cropping at the top; I can see you tried to "help" it with the frame, and might have been able better to help it with a frame that was wider at the top than on the other 3 sides. It also, to me, lacks the sharpness I''d liek to see in the rendering of the subject stone. The overall softness may have been intentionalon your part, but I''d have masked out the leaning stone and used a good dose of USM on it I think.</td>', 'In my mind this lovely image suffers from too tight cropping at the top; I can see you tried to "help" it with the frame, and might have been able better to help it with a frame that was wider at the top than on the other 3 sides. It also, to me, lacks the sharpness I''d liek to see in the rendering of the subject stone. The overall softness may have been intentionalon your part, but I''d have masked out the leaning stone and used a good dose of USM on it I think.', '2005-03-30 04:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258205, 158636, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is profoundly strange. Highly artificial and wildly creative. The use of neatimage isinteresting and effective; or whatever other means you used to get that effect. This is a shot that is staged in a graveyard but really is not "about" graveyards. That alone sets it apart.</td>', 'This is profoundly strange. Highly artificial and wildly creative. The use of neatimage isinteresting and effective; or whatever other means you used to get that effect. This is a shot that is staged in a graveyard but really is not "about" graveyards. That alone sets it apart.', '2005-03-30 04:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258207, 159011, 30861, '<td valign="top">wonderful, understaed, serene, contemplative. I hope it does better than i suspect it will.</td>', 'wonderful, understaed, serene, contemplative. I hope it does better than i suspect it will.', '2005-03-30 04:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258209, 160456, 30861, '<td valign="top">I find this curiously appealing. I think I''d find it even more so if the toning were other than this weak burgundy. My first reaction tot he overall tonal range was that it was too flat, needed some more contrast, but now I''m wavering on that.</td>', 'I find this curiously appealing. I think I''d find it even more so if the toning were other than this weak burgundy. My first reaction tot he overall tonal range was that it was too flat, needed some more contrast, but now I''m wavering on that.', '2005-03-30 04:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258210, 159658, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. I''d like it more if the building were aligned properly to the vertical, and if it were a little sharper.</td>', 'I like this very much. I''d like it more if the building were aligned properly to the vertical, and if it were a little sharper.', '2005-03-30 04:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258212, 158919, 30861, '<td valign="top">A nice infrared feel, pretty eeirie. Lack of separation of ball from sky on left edge bothers me. Composition a little too centered and pat for me.  I''d have tried cropping out the rightmost stone to get it a bit off-center on the main subject.</td>', 'A nice infrared feel, pretty eeirie. Lack of separation of ball from sky on left edge bothers me. Composition a little too centered and pat for me.  I''d have tried cropping out the rightmost stone to get it a bit off-center on the main subject.', '2005-03-30 04:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258213, 158899, 30861, '<td valign="top">Really strong and eerie, it leaves so many unanswered questions in my mind...</td>', 'Really strong and eerie, it leaves so many unanswered questions in my mind...', '2005-03-30 04:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258214, 160119, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sweet, moody, serene. I love the almost-symmetricality of it.</td>', 'Sweet, moody, serene. I love the almost-symmetricality of it.', '2005-03-30 04:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258219, 160377, 30861, '<td valign="top">In many ways this is just totally outstanding.  The juxtaposition of the main elements, however, is not as good as it might be.  The aggresive occlusion of the mausoleum by the tree on the right is particularly clumsy-feeling to me, and the statue seems too close to the mausoleum as well, not by a lot, but it''s sort of uncomfortable.  I think also a little too much foreground... nevertheless, a strong entry and should do well.</td>', 'In many ways this is just totally outstanding.  The juxtaposition of the main elements, however, is not as good as it might be.  The aggresive occlusion of the mausoleum by the tree on the right is particularly clumsy-feeling to me, and the statue seems too close to the mausoleum as well, not by a lot, but it''s sort of uncomfortable.  I think also a little too much foreground... nevertheless, a strong entry and should do well.', '2005-03-30 04:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258225, 159757, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. I hope it does well. The tonalities are luscious, the understated nature of it is appealing. I wish the bright grass blades top center were burned way back though, I find them distracting.</td>', 'I like this very much. I hope it does well. The tonalities are luscious, the understated nature of it is appealing. I wish the bright grass blades top center were burned way back though, I find them distracting.', '2005-03-30 05:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258286, 160435, 32595, '<td valign="top">hello..i very much like this pic........hi its me hope your having a good day<br/></td>', 'hello..i very much like this pic........hi its me hope your having a good day', '2005-03-30 06:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258293, 160164, 35723, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, shows great talent</td>', 'Excellent shot, shows great talent', '2005-03-30 06:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258308, 160305, 27482, '<td valign="top">Framed a little bit too tightly towards the top for my taste but otherwise very good, like the tonal depth in this shot.</td>', 'Framed a little bit too tightly towards the top for my taste but otherwise very good, like the tonal depth in this shot.', '2005-03-30 07:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258310, 160418, 18219, '<td valign="top">great picture, love it.<br/>It doesn''t look like a cemetery, it could  be the bottom of your garden for all I know, but who cares!!!</td>', 'great picture, love it.It doesn''t look like a cemetery, it could  be the bottom of your garden for all I know, but who cares!!!', '2005-03-30 07:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258316, 160511, 18219, '<td valign="top">the image looks a little busy.<br/>the "tomb" seems to get lost in the picture.<br/>but interesting none the less</td>', 'the image looks a little busy.the "tomb" seems to get lost in the picture.but interesting none the less', '2005-03-30 07:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258321, 159753, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice dof</td>', 'nice dof', '2005-03-30 07:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258322, 160153, 18219, '<td valign="top">nice attempt.<br/>but image seems slightly blurry</td>', 'nice attempt.but image seems slightly blurry', '2005-03-30 07:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258323, 160514, 18219, '<td valign="top">crisp and clear with good contrasting colors</td>', 'crisp and clear with good contrasting colors', '2005-03-30 07:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258344, 160340, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the framing in this shot also while this is one of many selective desat shots but one of the few that works, I like it and gave it an 8.</td>', 'I like the framing in this shot also while this is one of many selective desat shots but one of the few that works, I like it and gave it an 8.', '2005-03-30 08:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258370, 160517, 18644, '<td valign="top">SNow in snow, Now I get it LOL</td>', 'SNow in snow, Now I get it LOL', '2005-03-30 08:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258426, 159003, 13547, '<td valign="top">This really springs out at me as a brilliantly original idea.  So far I''ve seen nothing that has really grabbed my attention, but this really deserves a second look.</td>', 'This really springs out at me as a brilliantly original idea.  So far I''ve seen nothing that has really grabbed my attention, but this really deserves a second look.', '2005-03-30 09:20:47.000000', NULL, 1);
