(1260171, 160361, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around =) - I like your take on the challege.  I think that the composition is not as strong as it could be. Your title leads me to believe that the Peace tombstone should be the focus of the photograph, so maybe using depth of field to blur the background a little or zoom in on the Peace tomstone a little more.  Otherwise, nice photo!  =)</td>', 'This is my second go-around =) - I like your take on the challege.  I think that the composition is not as strong as it could be. Your title leads me to believe that the Peace tombstone should be the focus of the photograph, so maybe using depth of field to blur the background a little or zoom in on the Peace tomstone a little more.  Otherwise, nice photo!  =)', '2005-03-30 21:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
