(1261116, 160549, 27812, '<td valign="top">Your pic is ok, just the subject that does not appeal to me personally. I, however will not vote a subject down on my personal whimms. I''d rather look at the pic and try to understand the intend. For me in your pic there is a need for a focus point, eg use of DOF to highlight some specific area/object. Nothing really draws my eyes to it... maybe the red wreck.. but I don''t know. Bumping up on merit of your bravery, suppose a lot of members are going to hammer you with low scores.</td>', 'Your pic is ok, just the subject that does not appeal to me personally. I, however will not vote a subject down on my personal whimms. I''d rather look at the pic and try to understand the intend. For me in your pic there is a need for a focus point, eg use of DOF to highlight some specific area/object. Nothing really draws my eyes to it... maybe the red wreck.. but I don''t know. Bumping up on merit of your bravery, suppose a lot of members are going to hammer you with low scores.', '2005-03-31 07:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
