(1261124, 160548, 27812, '<td valign="top">I love spiders and hve a nice collection of them. When I vote your pic down it''s not for not meeting the challenge as many will say, I look at the pic on it''s own merit. In my opinion the spider lacks the crisp focus and details that would have done this otherwise good pic justice.</td>', 'I love spiders and hve a nice collection of them. When I vote your pic down it''s not for not meeting the challenge as many will say, I look at the pic on it''s own merit. In my opinion the spider lacks the crisp focus and details that would have done this otherwise good pic justice.', '2005-03-31 07:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261128, 159231, 27812, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this image just does not work for me. I think it may be a bit cluttered with objects that takes the eyes away from the focus point, which I must assume is the tombstone.</td>', 'Sorry but this image just does not work for me. I think it may be a bit cluttered with objects that takes the eyes away from the focus point, which I must assume is the tombstone.', '2005-03-31 07:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
