(1261181, 160229, 35044, '<td valign="top">interesting shapes - I like the sky too.  background to cross detracts a little from the shapes, maybe (though hard to see how that could be avoided).  Would be interested in seeing this reshot with shallow DoF to soften the background, but enough to retain the shape of that interesting church.</td>', 'interesting shapes - I like the sky too.  background to cross detracts a little from the shapes, maybe (though hard to see how that could be avoided).  Would be interested in seeing this reshot with shallow DoF to soften the background, but enough to retain the shape of that interesting church.', '2005-03-31 08:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
