(1261191, 158403, 35044, '<td valign="top">just don''t feel that the the ghosting is really working here - maybe in part because it is not very sharp.  Without wishing to offend, the patriotic call implicit in the flag may switch off some non-US voters - very slightly cheapens the image for me as it feels as though the symbol is being used to evoke an emotive response that the picture would not otherwise demand.</td>', 'just don''t feel that the the ghosting is really working here - maybe in part because it is not very sharp.  Without wishing to offend, the patriotic call implicit in the flag may switch off some non-US voters - very slightly cheapens the image for me as it feels as though the symbol is being used to evoke an emotive response that the picture would not otherwise demand.', '2005-03-31 08:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261192, 160520, 35044, '<td valign="top">Like the motion in the flag and strong colours.  background is a little distracting - chain link not up there with the best of background imagery!<br/> <br/>Without wishing to offend, the patriotic call implicit in the flag may switch off some non-US voters - very slightly cheapens the image for me as it feels as though the symbol is being used to evoke an emotive response that the picture would not otherwise demand.</td>', 'Like the motion in the flag and strong colours.  background is a little distracting - chain link not up there with the best of background imagery! Without wishing to offend, the patriotic call implicit in the flag may switch off some non-US voters - very slightly cheapens the image for me as it feels as though the symbol is being used to evoke an emotive response that the picture would not otherwise demand.', '2005-03-31 08:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261193, 160210, 35044, '<td valign="top">technically very good use of desat - normally a turn off for me when this bold, but this is better than most.  Maybe losing a little too much detail in the top of frame.<br/> <br/>Without wishing to offend, the patriotic call implicit in the flag may switch off some non-US voters - very slightly cheapens the image for me as it feels as though the symbol is being used to evoke an emotive response that the picture would not otherwise demand.</td>', 'technically very good use of desat - normally a turn off for me when this bold, but this is better than most.  Maybe losing a little too much detail in the top of frame. Without wishing to offend, the patriotic call implicit in the flag may switch off some non-US voters - very slightly cheapens the image for me as it feels as though the symbol is being used to evoke an emotive response that the picture would not otherwise demand.', '2005-03-31 08:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261196, 159481, 35044, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a good use of the US flag symbolism - I have said on some other images using the flag that "Without wishing to offend, the patriotic call implicit in the flag may switch off some non-US voters - very slightly cheapens the image for me as it feels as though the symbol is being used to evoke an emotive response that the picture would not otherwise demand."  Here, I think that you have managed to combine it with a little more dignity and relevance than most. <br/> <br/>However, I am not a fan of the selective desat - too much white here for a full desat to work, I think.  Maybe a muted tone would have worked better?</td>', 'I think that this is a good use of the US flag symbolism - I have said on some other images using the flag that "Without wishing to offend, the patriotic call implicit in the flag may switch off some non-US voters - very slightly cheapens the image for me as it feels as though the symbol is being used to evoke an emotive response that the picture would not otherwise demand."  Here, I think that you have managed to combine it with a little more dignity and relevance than most.  However, I am not a fan of the selective desat - too much white here for a full desat to work, I think.  Maybe a muted tone would have worked better?', '2005-03-31 08:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261197, 159683, 35044, '<td valign="top">Noice colours.  Background v distracting - flowers and grave alone might have been more interesting.</td>', 'Noice colours.  Background v distracting - flowers and grave alone might have been more interesting.', '2005-03-31 08:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261199, 160367, 35044, '<td valign="top">Interesting story - but the interest largely comes from the words, not the image as a whole. Horizon is slanting.  Background is distracting (too much detail behind trees)</td>', 'Interesting story - but the interest largely comes from the words, not the image as a whole. Horizon is slanting.  Background is distracting (too much detail behind trees)', '2005-03-31 08:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
