(1262135, 160227, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go-around  =) -  Very nice!  The color is a little muddy, but may be my monitor.  I really like it a lot!  Great job!</td>', 'This is my second go-around  =) -  Very nice!  The color is a little muddy, but may be my monitor.  I really like it a lot!  Great job!', '2005-03-31 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262138, 159021, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go around =) - Very nice!  I would have liked to see some more highlights, or bright whites because it looks a little flat.  However, I still think you did an excellent job and great choice of location!</td>', 'This is my second go around =) - Very nice!  I would have liked to see some more highlights, or bright whites because it looks a little flat.  However, I still think you did an excellent job and great choice of location!', '2005-03-31 15:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262140, 160160, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go around =) - Great creativity!  I am a little unsure of your composition... looks a little unbalanced.  However, I like your take on the challenge and that you tried this unsual angle.  Great job!</td>', 'This is my second go around =) - Great creativity!  I am a little unsure of your composition... looks a little unbalanced.  However, I like your take on the challenge and that you tried this unsual angle.  Great job!', '2005-03-31 15:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262141, 160258, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go around =) - took me a minute to figure out what your title meant... but really like use of b&amp;w and contrast is excellent.  I would have dodged and burned some places on the tombstone to make the dates more visible... so it''s easier to see what you mean by "11."  However, I really like your take on this challenge.  Great job!</td>', 'This is my second go around =) - took me a minute to figure out what your title meant... but really like use of b&w and contrast is excellent.  I would have dodged and burned some places on the tombstone to make the dates more visible... so it''s easier to see what you mean by "11."  However, I really like your take on this challenge.  Great job!', '2005-03-31 15:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262145, 160590, 35021, '<td valign="top">This is my second go around =) - Very nice!  The colors look a little muted... I would have adjusted your contrast slightly and/or color saturation.  However, great idea for the challenge.</td>', 'This is my second go around =) - Very nice!  The colors look a little muted... I would have adjusted your contrast slightly and/or color saturation.  However, great idea for the challenge.', '2005-03-31 15:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
