(1264082, 160441, 20779, '<td valign="top">Well done image and very emotive. My only nit-pick on this one is that the crop is a bit too tight and centered for me. I would like to see the image breath more - but just my personal opinion or view.</td>', 'Well done image and very emotive. My only nit-pick on this one is that the crop is a bit too tight and centered for me. I would like to see the image breath more - but just my personal opinion or view.', '2005-04-01 19:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
