(1264087, 159021, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed shot. My only nit-pick is that the tonal range isn''t quite wide enough in my opinion; not so much a "dark" image, but more that it is missing some highlights. Sorry that I am probably not communicating this well.</td>', 'Beautifully executed shot. My only nit-pick is that the tonal range isn''t quite wide enough in my opinion; not so much a "dark" image, but more that it is missing some highlights. Sorry that I am probably not communicating this well.', '2005-04-01 19:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264088, 160286, 20779, '<td valign="top">Incredibly powerful image. Extremely emotive and beautifully done in every way.</td>', 'Incredibly powerful image. Extremely emotive and beautifully done in every way.', '2005-04-01 19:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264090, 160555, 20779, '<td valign="top">Intriguing use of the tones and colors. Almost has a touch of magic in it.</td>', 'Intriguing use of the tones and colors. Almost has a touch of magic in it.', '2005-04-01 19:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264096, 159292, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene captured and the appearance of fog is perfect. The tone is a bit too blue for my personal taste, and the tonal range a bit narrow. I don''t, of course, know what you were working with, but in  a perfect world, I would prefer the statue not be tilted and cut off at the bottom, but it is a "nit-pick".</td>', 'Beautiful scene captured and the appearance of fog is perfect. The tone is a bit too blue for my personal taste, and the tonal range a bit narrow. I don''t, of course, know what you were working with, but in  a perfect world, I would prefer the statue not be tilted and cut off at the bottom, but it is a "nit-pick".', '2005-04-01 19:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264099, 160522, 20779, '<td valign="top">Exquisite statue and I love the grain you captured in the stone. I personally find statues by themselves make for a rather "static" image, particularly with the blown out sky. Focus is good and sharp.</td>', 'Exquisite statue and I love the grain you captured in the stone. I personally find statues by themselves make for a rather "static" image, particularly with the blown out sky. Focus is good and sharp.', '2005-04-01 19:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264106, 160405, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love the scene you captured in this. I would have preferred a bit less blur in the background - it looks a little too soft for me. I am on the fence about the de-sat, but I think I would have preferred a bit softer of yellow. All this is, of course, just my personal opinion.</td>', 'I love the scene you captured in this. I would have preferred a bit less blur in the background - it looks a little too soft for me. I am on the fence about the de-sat, but I think I would have preferred a bit softer of yellow. All this is, of course, just my personal opinion.', '2005-04-01 19:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264109, 160333, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very expansive and beautiful scene. As a personal opinion, I think the blue tone is too heavy. I think I might have cropped in more on a tighter shot of the crosses and straightened the horizon.  For some reason, the mountains and clouds appear a bit over-sharpened, yet the foreground is softer.</td>', 'Very expansive and beautiful scene. As a personal opinion, I think the blue tone is too heavy. I think I might have cropped in more on a tighter shot of the crosses and straightened the horizon.  For some reason, the mountains and clouds appear a bit over-sharpened, yet the foreground is softer.', '2005-04-01 19:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264115, 160052, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice tonal range and graceful composition. The orange is a bit to "loud" in relation to the rest of the image in my personal opinion. I don''t think I would have chosen de-sat for this particular image, but just an opinion, obviously.</td>', 'Very nice tonal range and graceful composition. The orange is a bit to "loud" in relation to the rest of the image in my personal opinion. I don''t think I would have chosen de-sat for this particular image, but just an opinion, obviously.', '2005-04-01 19:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264116, 160272, 34382, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.</td>', 'Nice pic.', '2005-04-01 19:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264118, 160523, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think this is an amazing composition, and great tonal range and lighting captured. My two nit-picks are that the flowers are too bright and plastic looking for me (I think I would have not kept them in color) and the foreground details a bit soft for my taste.</td>', 'I think this is an amazing composition, and great tonal range and lighting captured. My two nit-picks are that the flowers are too bright and plastic looking for me (I think I would have not kept them in color) and the foreground details a bit soft for my taste.', '2005-04-01 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264124, 159902, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very serene scene captures. For my personal tastes, the color tone is too yellowish red and not enough tonal range for contrast.</td>', 'Very serene scene captures. For my personal tastes, the color tone is too yellowish red and not enough tonal range for contrast.', '2005-04-01 20:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
