(1264133, 160307, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture! The tone is a little too blue for my personal tastes.</td>', 'Beautiful capture! The tone is a little too blue for my personal tastes.', '2005-04-01 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264138, 160414, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture and tones. My only nit-pick is that the crop/framing of the subject is a bit too tight and centered for my personal taste.</td>', 'Very nice capture and tones. My only nit-pick is that the crop/framing of the subject is a bit too tight and centered for my personal taste.', '2005-04-01 20:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264145, 159020, 20779, '<td valign="top">Nice scope of vision and perspective. The colors aren''t right for me, though. The partial de-sat has left the grass looking like a dirty gray with a sickly green cast. I would have preferred either the color left or a full de-sat of all color and contrast bumped up. BUT- just a personal opinion. The angle is a little satis - it may give it more impact if the image was cropped at the upper horizon line.</td>', 'Nice scope of vision and perspective. The colors aren''t right for me, though. The partial de-sat has left the grass looking like a dirty gray with a sickly green cast. I would have preferred either the color left or a full de-sat of all color and contrast bumped up. BUT- just a personal opinion. The angle is a little satis - it may give it more impact if the image was cropped at the upper horizon line.', '2005-04-01 20:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264146, 160249, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love this scene, and it needs the flowers as a focal point, but for me - the flowers were left too brightly and deeply saturated. It is too jarring of a juxtaposition for my feelings towards the setting.</td>', 'I love this scene, and it needs the flowers as a focal point, but for me - the flowers were left too brightly and deeply saturated. It is too jarring of a juxtaposition for my feelings towards the setting.', '2005-04-01 20:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264147, 159388, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the off-center composition and clean simplicity. The focus is a bit too blurry to completely carry the image in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the off-center composition and clean simplicity. The focus is a bit too blurry to completely carry the image in my opinion.', '2005-04-01 20:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264149, 160172, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the movement and composition. The blue-green tint is not right for my personal tastes. It gives a hazy, messy look to the image for me.</td>', 'I like the movement and composition. The blue-green tint is not right for my personal tastes. It gives a hazy, messy look to the image for me.', '2005-04-01 20:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264150, 160406, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think you found a great capture for this iamge, but for me, this image is too heavily processed in an unappealing way.</td>', 'I think you found a great capture for this iamge, but for me, this image is too heavily processed in an unappealing way.', '2005-04-01 20:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1264152, 160428, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice and serene capture. In my personal opinion, it would have been more effective to use a wider tonal range and more contrast, and not have kept the flowers in color. If color is kept, I would have gone for a softer, paler color.</td>', 'Very nice and serene capture. In my personal opinion, it would have been more effective to use a wider tonal range and more contrast, and not have kept the flowers in color. If color is kept, I would have gone for a softer, paler color.', '2005-04-01 20:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
