(1268126, 159376, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment:<br/>I gave this image a 6. It is a good composition but the tones in the background are very mutted. I realize the challenge here. You have a white angel and a white sky and while this look is not all that bad it begs extra attention since the general feel is more like a silhoutte. Observing the image I would have raised the gamma as the angel can take it without suffering. This will give some wanted relief in the background.</td>', 'Returning for comment:I gave this image a 6. It is a good composition but the tones in the background are very mutted. I realize the challenge here. You have a white angel and a white sky and while this look is not all that bad it begs extra attention since the general feel is more like a silhoutte. Observing the image I would have raised the gamma as the angel can take it without suffering. This will give some wanted relief in the background.', '2005-04-03 22:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268127, 160615, 31213, '<td valign="top">Simple...and pleasant to look at.  Like the composition...I think I would ahve liked to see a contrasty B&amp;W more than the sepia.</td>', 'Simple...and pleasant to look at.  Like the composition...I think I would ahve liked to see a contrasty B&W more than the sepia.', '2005-04-03 22:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
