(1268522, 160552, 32033, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank everyone for their comments.  I do see the errors of my shot.  I, in the future will slow down take a few more shots and look at the different angles.<br/> <br/>Thanks again</td>', 'I would like to thank everyone for their comments.  I do see the errors of my shot.  I, in the future will slow down take a few more shots and look at the different angles. Thanks again', '2005-04-04 01:10:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268526, 158899, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully melancholic scene. Just perfect. Congrats on the high placing.</td>', 'Wonderfully melancholic scene. Just perfect. Congrats on the high placing.', '2005-04-04 01:11:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268536, 160544, 93, '<td valign="top">Ok.. so I''ve learned something. Actually, I already knew it.  Being artistic and different with a challenge kills you.. but gets you some great comments too (and some really dumb ones..  PhotoRyno.. please, get a damn imagination :))<br/> <br/>The soft-focus was intentional. I wanted a Ghostly, deadish appearance, and this gives it that.  If I was to do it again, I''d go for the exact same look.  Sorry that not everyone (ok, hardly anyone), likes it.  I''ve always been that kind of artist though.<br/> <br/>Also, read the description to find out why these trees were cut down. Thanks!</td>', 'Ok.. so I''ve learned something. Actually, I already knew it.  Being artistic and different with a challenge kills you.. but gets you some great comments too (and some really dumb ones..  PhotoRyno.. please, get a damn imagination :)) The soft-focus was intentional. I wanted a Ghostly, deadish appearance, and this gives it that.  If I was to do it again, I''d go for the exact same look.  Sorry that not everyone (ok, hardly anyone), likes it.  I''ve always been that kind of artist though. Also, read the description to find out why these trees were cut down. Thanks!', '2005-04-04 01:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268543, 158801, 1827, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning.</td>', 'Simply stunning.', '2005-04-04 01:13:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268557, 159229, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely simplicity of composition, understated photo.  I''m glad that Blue and your Red in this challenge were both vertical (portrait) layout, as a quiet way to emphasize the true realm of the cemetary, the relationship between earth and heaven, terrestrial and celestial. Cemetaries are more than resting places for human remains.  They are thresholds, inviting us to look beyond this brief transitory existence into the mystery, wonder and glory of the life beyond. Congrats on your 2nd place photo, pointing us beyound the grass, trees, and even beyound the clouds.</td>', 'Lovely simplicity of composition, understated photo.  I''m glad that Blue and your Red in this challenge were both vertical (portrait) layout, as a quiet way to emphasize the true realm of the cemetary, the relationship between earth and heaven, terrestrial and celestial. Cemetaries are more than resting places for human remains.  They are thresholds, inviting us to look beyond this brief transitory existence into the mystery, wonder and glory of the life beyond. Congrats on your 2nd place photo, pointing us beyound the grass, trees, and even beyound the clouds.', '2005-04-04 01:16:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268559, 159229, 30959, '<td valign="top">Nice job, love the drama working here with light, dark, shadows, green grass and the organization of graves. Chaos in life, order in death..brr..anyway, I think I''ve seen enough graves for a long time.</td>', 'Nice job, love the drama working here with light, dark, shadows, green grass and the organization of graves. Chaos in life, order in death..brr..anyway, I think I''ve seen enough graves for a long time.', '2005-04-04 01:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268568, 160474, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great job for your first attempt at dodge and burn. Congrats!<br/> <br/>After merging the sky back into the rest of the image you might have wanted to clone out the haloing around the edge building in places. You may have left that there intentionally, but to my eye it looks like incomplete post processing.</td>', 'Great job for your first attempt at dodge and burn. Congrats! After merging the sky back into the rest of the image you might have wanted to clone out the haloing around the edge building in places. You may have left that there intentionally, but to my eye it looks like incomplete post processing.', '2005-04-04 01:17:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268573, 159292, 30959, '<td valign="top">Nice job on this, particularly of not letting the trees dominate, good composition. How much did that fog machine set you back!</td>', 'Nice job on this, particularly of not letting the trees dominate, good composition. How much did that fog machine set you back!', '2005-04-04 01:18:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268575, 159789, 8891, '<td valign="top">This was my only 10 in the challenge. Thought it would have finished way higher. I like that you caught your ''stuntman'' in mid flight but with the angle you used, there was just enough of a ghost effect for me towards his feet making it look like he was being pulled towards the after life instead of jumping into the grave. Nice idea and work.</td>', 'This was my only 10 in the challenge. Thought it would have finished way higher. I like that you caught your ''stuntman'' in mid flight but with the angle you used, there was just enough of a ghost effect for me towards his feet making it look like he was being pulled towards the after life instead of jumping into the grave. Nice idea and work.', '2005-04-04 01:19:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268580, 160377, 30959, '<td valign="top">Outstanding job on this, had it picked for a top finisher.</td>', 'Outstanding job on this, had it picked for a top finisher.', '2005-04-04 01:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268585, 159907, 33379, '<td valign="top">wow cant believe this, thought it wouldve been higher.</td>', 'wow cant believe this, thought it wouldve been higher.', '2005-04-04 01:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268591, 159240, 27164, '<td valign="top">I think that in order to be effective as a cemetery photo, the gravestone should be in focus, with the flowers out of focus, and not taking up quite as much of the photo.</td>', 'I think that in order to be effective as a cemetery photo, the gravestone should be in focus, with the flowers out of focus, and not taking up quite as much of the photo.', '2005-04-04 01:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268593, 159292, 5792, '<td valign="top">Sonya, another great image from you. Your growth and change as a photographer has been amazing to witness and this is just another fine example of that. What will you come up with next?</td>', 'Sonya, another great image from you. Your growth and change as a photographer has been amazing to witness and this is just another fine example of that. What will you come up with next?', '2005-04-04 01:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268594, 159240, 8891, '<td valign="top">too much flowers, and they are great flowers and well shot, but not enough cemetery.</td>', 'too much flowers, and they are great flowers and well shot, but not enough cemetery.', '2005-04-04 01:21:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268605, 159876, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great shot... when it comes to moody images you are The Best!</td>', 'Great shot... when it comes to moody images you are The Best!', '2005-04-04 01:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268617, 160562, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great mood and moon shadow. It captures the feel of a cemetery at night perfectly.</td>', 'Great mood and moon shadow. It captures the feel of a cemetery at night perfectly.', '2005-04-04 01:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268632, 159020, 5792, '<td valign="top">Neatly trimmed national cemeteries inspire a reverance different from any other cemetery. Good job capturing that.</td>', 'Neatly trimmed national cemeteries inspire a reverance different from any other cemetery. Good job capturing that.', '2005-04-04 01:27:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268635, 160455, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and interesting lighting.</td>', 'Great perspective and interesting lighting.', '2005-04-04 01:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268651, 158636, 6388, '<td valign="top">I still love this.  almost 50 votes at 4 or less?  when will these *ahem* voters figure out that it''s a PHOTOGRAPHY contest not a moral trial by jury.  who gives a crap if you don''t like the subject?  It''s in a cemetery, ergo it meets the damn challenge.  It''s a technically well executed photo.  how on earth could that equal a 1?  gr.<br/> <br/>Anyway, J - this is fab.  well done.  deserved better.  a LOT better.<br/> <br/>high five to all those who could see past their own egos and voted it fairly even if they objected to the subject matter.</td>', 'I still love this.  almost 50 votes at 4 or less?  when will these *ahem* voters figure out that it''s a PHOTOGRAPHY contest not a moral trial by jury.  who gives a crap if you don''t like the subject?  It''s in a cemetery, ergo it meets the damn challenge.  It''s a technically well executed photo.  how on earth could that equal a 1?  gr. Anyway, J - this is fab.  well done.  deserved better.  a LOT better. high five to all those who could see past their own egos and voted it fairly even if they objected to the subject matter.', '2005-04-04 01:30:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268652, 159240, 28141, '<td valign="top">I too would prefer the grave stone(s) in focus.  The flowers are pretty, but by having them in focus, they become the subject of the photo, thereby making it fit the challenge less.</td>', 'I too would prefer the grave stone(s) in focus.  The flowers are pretty, but by having them in focus, they become the subject of the photo, thereby making it fit the challenge less.', '2005-04-04 01:31:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268663, 160261, 6388, '<td valign="top">because, my dear...people are stupid.  that''s why this scored below what it deserved. :)</td>', 'because, my dear...people are stupid.  that''s why this scored below what it deserved. :)', '2005-04-04 01:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268710, 159595, 32265, '<td valign="top">so is that the actual sky? judging from the top of the trees, it looks to be cropped out and replaced.</td>', 'so is that the actual sky? judging from the top of the trees, it looks to be cropped out and replaced.', '2005-04-04 01:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268735, 159240, 5792, '<td valign="top">Unsure that the soft focused gravstones make much of a difference. Cemeteries generally invoke strong feelings and most of the high rated images in the challenge were on the melancholy side. By comparison yours is colorful and almost happy and that probably hurt your score.<br/> <br/>The perspective is not that interesting and looks like you just stopped to take the shot looking downward. A different angle might have worked better.<br/> <br/>If you don''t come home from taking outdoor pictures with contorted soreness in your body then you probably took most pictures from a dull perspective. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-04 00:45:03.</i></td>', 'Unsure that the soft focused gravstones make much of a difference. Cemeteries generally invoke strong feelings and most of the high rated images in the challenge were on the melancholy side. By comparison yours is colorful and almost happy and that probably hurt your score. The perspective is not that interesting and looks like you just stopped to take the shot looking downward. A different angle might have worked better. If you don''t come home from taking outdoor pictures with contorted soreness in your body then you probably took most pictures from a dull perspective. :)', '2005-04-04 01:43:03.000000', '2005-04-04 01:45:03.000000', 0),
(1268776, 158801, 28742, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! I love the cloud detail. Congratulations!</td>', 'Awesome shot! I love the cloud detail. Congratulations!', '2005-04-04 01:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268785, 159229, 28742, '<td valign="top">Outstanding job! This was actually my pick for the blue, but lots of tough competition! Congrats!</td>', 'Outstanding job! This was actually my pick for the blue, but lots of tough competition! Congrats!', '2005-04-04 01:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268838, 159485, 28742, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think this was too bad. I had a similar one, but let my wife pick a different shot to enter. Here is my out-take:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=160777" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28742/thumb/160777.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28742/thumb/160777.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/28742/thumb/160777.jpg"/></a> <br/>I think you may have done better to put the focus on "Pepper" instead of the salt.</td>', 'I didn''t think this was too bad. I had a similar one, but let my wife pick a different shot to enter. Here is my out-take: I think you may have done better to put the focus on "Pepper" instead of the salt.', '2005-04-04 02:00:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268848, 158801, 35122, '<td valign="top">Breath taking!!!!  Awesome!!!</td>', 'Breath taking!!!!  Awesome!!!', '2005-04-04 02:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268874, 159292, 5313, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Soni!  What a lovely image!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations, Soni!  What a lovely image! ', '2005-04-04 02:08:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268907, 158801, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! I knew this was winner. Congratulations!</td>', 'Outstanding! I knew this was winner. Congratulations!', '2005-04-04 02:14:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268917, 159229, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. Congratulations!</td>', 'Wonderful image. Congratulations!', '2005-04-04 02:16:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268922, 159143, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image! Congratulations!</td>', 'Wonderful image! Congratulations!', '2005-04-04 02:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268940, 158801, 15305, '<td valign="top">Thanks <b>a lot</b> to all of you for your comments and high scores. This is a first for me in many ways, and it''s really encouraging.</td>', 'Thanks a lot to all of you for your comments and high scores. This is a first for me in many ways, and it''s really encouraging.', '2005-04-04 02:20:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268974, 158636, 32108, '<td valign="top">I''m with Pedro - gave you a 10:)</td>', 'I''m with Pedro - gave you a 10:)', '2005-04-04 02:28:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1268978, 159876, 15305, '<td valign="top">I really thought this was going to be in top 3. Congrats on such a great shot. You definitely are a master.</td>', 'I really thought this was going to be in top 3. Congrats on such a great shot. You definitely are a master.', '2005-04-04 02:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269007, 160478, 8284, '<td valign="top">I did hope to do better than this, but that''s what I get for entering a challenge I didn''t feel I had a decent picture for, right?  Maybe next time I''ll go with my instinct.<br/> <br/>In any case, I do appreciate the comments - all 3 of them.  See you all next time!</td>', 'I did hope to do better than this, but that''s what I get for entering a challenge I didn''t feel I had a decent picture for, right?  Maybe next time I''ll go with my instinct. In any case, I do appreciate the comments - all 3 of them.  See you all next time!', '2005-04-04 02:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269057, 160033, 200, '<td valign="top">this was my favorite of the challenge. :)</td>', 'this was my favorite of the challenge. :)', '2005-04-04 03:04:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269078, 160012, 16230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image Wendy!</td>', 'Beautiful image Wendy!', '2005-04-04 03:15:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269082, 158801, 2022, '<td valign="top">Congratulations ! Well deserved ribbon !</td>', 'Congratulations ! Well deserved ribbon !', '2005-04-04 03:17:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269083, 159229, 2022, '<td valign="top">Congratulations ! I am happy one of my favorites ribboned !</td>', 'Congratulations ! I am happy one of my favorites ribboned !', '2005-04-04 03:18:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269084, 159143, 2022, '<td valign="top">Congratulations !</td>', 'Congratulations !', '2005-04-04 03:18:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269098, 160172, 35537, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the helpful comments guys and gals. After looking back at my shot after I submitted it, I realized I definitely needed to tone down the house quite a bit more, as it looked out of place.<br/> <br/>The angled shot was to give the impression of the view from someone laying sideways on the ground, a body for example, or like Connie mentioned, someone creeping into the cemetary late at night.</td>', 'Thanks for all the helpful comments guys and gals. After looking back at my shot after I submitted it, I realized I definitely needed to tone down the house quite a bit more, as it looked out of place. The angled shot was to give the impression of the view from someone laying sideways on the ground, a body for example, or like Connie mentioned, someone creeping into the cemetary late at night.', '2005-04-04 03:24:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269116, 159513, 31409, '<td valign="top">I had given this an 8. I liked the shadows and effect of peeling paint on the walls.</td>', 'I had given this an 8. I liked the shadows and effect of peeling paint on the walls.', '2005-04-04 03:30:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269131, 160369, 31409, '<td valign="top">No wonder it looked familiar, I visited this cemetery 11 years ago. Well worth visiting this Pueblo. The mountains behind it really add to it.</td>', 'No wonder it looked familiar, I visited this cemetery 11 years ago. Well worth visiting this Pueblo. The mountains behind it really add to it.', '2005-04-04 03:36:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269176, 158899, 27845, '<td valign="top">I think this one should have brought you a blue one. It''s exactly the creepiness which you mention that makes this shot so great.</td>', 'I think this one should have brought you a blue one. It''s exactly the creepiness which you mention that makes this shot so great.', '2005-04-04 03:49:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269178, 160550, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, Harvey. I like it a lot.</td>', 'This is very nice, Harvey. I like it a lot.', '2005-04-04 03:49:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269198, 158636, 27845, '<td valign="top">Me three. I''d have liked to see this one in the top three, along with e301''s. It''s the dynamic composition which strikes me most.</td>', 'Me three. I''d have liked to see this one in the top three, along with e301''s. It''s the dynamic composition which strikes me most.', '2005-04-04 03:55:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269259, 159876, 9913, '<td valign="top">..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-20 03:53:48.</i></td>', '..', '2005-04-04 04:13:03.000000', '2005-09-20 04:53:48.000000', 0),
(1269264, 158801, 31637, '<td valign="top">It looks like I got my wish, you really deserved it. I knew you would win.</td>', 'It looks like I got my wish, you really deserved it. I knew you would win.', '2005-04-04 04:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269265, 159229, 31637, '<td valign="top">Proud to call this. I congratulate you!</td>', 'Proud to call this. I congratulate you!', '2005-04-04 04:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269272, 159143, 31637, '<td valign="top">amazing image. It really stands out and demands attention. The overexposed sky works well...congrats on your first ribbon.</td>', 'amazing image. It really stands out and demands attention. The overexposed sky works well...congrats on your first ribbon.', '2005-04-04 04:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269302, 159876, 31637, '<td valign="top">I knew it!</td>', 'I knew it!', '2005-04-04 04:34:51.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1269325, 160261, 19708, '<td valign="top">I''m just a bit <i>(a lot actually)</i> taken back by the low placement in the challenge.<br/>:(<br/>Guess no dramatic burned /dark skies = no high placement, forget that the composition is well-done and needs more that a 2 second glance to appreciate.<br/>Do us and yourself a favor sher and DON''T change what and how you do it - it''s a gift.</td>', 'I''m just a bit (a lot actually) taken back by the low placement in the challenge.:(Guess no dramatic burned /dark skies = no high placement, forget that the composition is well-done and needs more that a 2 second glance to appreciate.Do us and yourself a favor sher and DON''T change what and how you do it - it''s a gift.', '2005-04-04 04:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269326, 159292, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Soni!<br/>Nice choice of tone too.</td>', 'Nice shot Soni!Nice choice of tone too.', '2005-04-04 04:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269328, 160307, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beutiful shot Peter.<br/>The colors are great just as they are.</td>', 'Beutiful shot Peter.The colors are great just as they are.', '2005-04-04 04:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269330, 160053, 23251, '<td valign="top">Well Done Bruce!  Great result.</td>', 'Well Done Bruce!  Great result.', '2005-04-04 04:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269333, 158801, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very well composed shot. Be it luck or not, the lighting was perfect.<br/>Congrats on your Blue Ribbon here.</td>', 'Very well composed shot. Be it luck or not, the lighting was perfect.Congrats on your Blue Ribbon here.', '2005-04-04 04:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269337, 159229, 19708, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Red Stephen!<br/>One heck of a sky.</td>', 'Congrats on your Red Stephen!One heck of a sky.', '2005-04-04 05:00:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269338, 160377, 26849, '<td valign="top">I liked the statue and mausoleum composition idea. This shot was taken on the second day, the earlier image was shot higher. This was shot about a foot off the ground and made a stronger image. <br/> <br/>Spent more time editing this challenge image than any other I can remember. I really wanted to edit towards a very dramatic lighting scene.<br/> <br/>There was no sun breaking through the clouds. The lighting effect was created by dodging and burning with the idea of creating an uneven look as it would if the clouds were really thick and thin.<br/> <br/>The background sky was more difficult than the rest, nature did not give me exactly what I wanted that day. I re-did the sky editing 2 or 3 times to get it to this look.<br/> <br/>No Neat Image. Don''t own that software yet.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I liked the statue and mausoleum composition idea. This shot was taken on the second day, the earlier image was shot higher. This was shot about a foot off the ground and made a stronger image.  Spent more time editing this challenge image than any other I can remember. I really wanted to edit towards a very dramatic lighting scene. There was no sun breaking through the clouds. The lighting effect was created by dodging and burning with the idea of creating an uneven look as it would if the clouds were really thick and thin. The background sky was more difficult than the rest, nature did not give me exactly what I wanted that day. I re-did the sky editing 2 or 3 times to get it to this look. No Neat Image. Don''t own that software yet. ', '2005-04-04 05:01:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269406, 159798, 22125, '<td valign="top">The voters just didn''t understand the concept of this, tecnically you did a great job and dont let them worry you, I was there and it was great fun and a great experience and thats what photography is all about, not winning or losing , your personal taste is never the same as anyone else but you should take pics to please you nobody else, your bloody lucky you didn''t get another Brown ribbon lol. better luck next time.<br/>Bruce.</td>', 'The voters just didn''t understand the concept of this, tecnically you did a great job and dont let them worry you, I was there and it was great fun and a great experience and thats what photography is all about, not winning or losing , your personal taste is never the same as anyone else but you should take pics to please you nobody else, your bloody lucky you didn''t get another Brown ribbon lol. better luck next time.Bruce.', '2005-04-04 06:17:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269407, 160033, 15810, '<td valign="top">This was my top pick of the challenge<br/> <br/>Doesn''t deserve to be 47th <br/> <br/>I think the voters got a little confused and voted down a superb shot because <i>they</i> found it a little tasteless. I voted on the photography and still think it should be a ribbon pic.<br/> <br/>Steve</td>', 'This was my top pick of the challenge Doesn''t deserve to be 47th  I think the voters got a little confused and voted down a superb shot because they found it a little tasteless. I voted on the photography and still think it should be a ribbon pic. Steve', '2005-04-04 06:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269409, 160046, 22125, '<td valign="top">Congratulation Kirsty, well done.</td>', 'Congratulation Kirsty, well done.', '2005-04-04 06:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269412, 158801, 9913, '<td valign="top">skies are cool but I think you could have done a better job photoshoping this one though!</td>', 'skies are cool but I think you could have done a better job photoshoping this one though!', '2005-04-04 06:22:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269414, 160229, 22125, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Ev, top shot, well done.</td>', 'Congratulations Ev, top shot, well done.', '2005-04-04 06:22:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269426, 160544, 35044, '<td valign="top">Amazing that others did not see the graveyard in this: this was one of the pics I rated high.  I liked it a lot!  Remember that scores are not everything.</td>', 'Amazing that others did not see the graveyard in this: this was one of the pics I rated high.  I liked it a lot!  Remember that scores are not everything.', '2005-04-04 06:44:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269430, 159876, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow - I''m amazed that''s actually human (I think nazgul qualifies as human at least :P). <br/> <br/>I''m surprised this wasn''t a lot closer to a 7.0</td>', 'Wow - I''m amazed that''s actually human (I think nazgul qualifies as human at least :P).  I''m surprised this wasn''t a lot closer to a 7.0', '2005-04-04 06:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269431, 159876, 31443, '<td valign="top">Should have known who this was! Heiða flott enn og aftur!</td>', 'Should have known who this was! Heiða flott enn og aftur!', '2005-04-04 06:59:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1269434, 160377, 24764, '<td valign="top">There is a sense of magnificence to this cinematic shot.</td>', 'There is a sense of magnificence to this cinematic shot.', '2005-04-04 07:08:41.000000', NULL, 0),
