(1269810, 160335, 35044, '<td valign="top">Interesting non-traditional compisition.  Like the detail and tone.  However, that strip of very green grass does not include any features that draw my attention to it - and does not (in my view) quite balance the strong RHS of the picture.  <br/> <br/>The two graves at the top right are distractions - wonder if you could have included more of them or cloned them out.<br/> <br/>The message is not particularly universal - Confederate or not makes little impact on me (but I assume it may have some significance). <br/> <br/>Overall - a nice shot that probably suffered a little (possibly rightly so) for the unusual composition.</td>', 'Interesting non-traditional compisition.  Like the detail and tone.  However, that strip of very green grass does not include any features that draw my attention to it - and does not (in my view) quite balance the strong RHS of the picture.   The two graves at the top right are distractions - wonder if you could have included more of them or cloned them out. The message is not particularly universal - Confederate or not makes little impact on me (but I assume it may have some significance).  Overall - a nice shot that probably suffered a little (possibly rightly so) for the unusual composition.', '2005-04-04 11:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
