(1270779, 159143, 31042, '<td valign="top">I think your dodging and burning needs a little work, and the cross in the sky is a little crispy with the pixels.  Sorry, but also im not fond of the mismatched placement of the stones on the ground as well.  I think the sky is too bright and the ground is too dark, and I don''t really like the colour of the sky.  I really stand out from the rest of the commments, but this is how i feel.</td>', 'I think your dodging and burning needs a little work, and the cross in the sky is a little crispy with the pixels.  Sorry, but also im not fond of the mismatched placement of the stones on the ground as well.  I think the sky is too bright and the ground is too dark, and I don''t really like the colour of the sky.  I really stand out from the rest of the commments, but this is how i feel.', '2005-04-04 17:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1270813, 160554, 14773, '<td valign="top">I personally like just about any effect that creates interest.  In a challenge full of concrete slabs just staring at you; this is some nice work.</td>', 'I personally like just about any effect that creates interest.  In a challenge full of concrete slabs just staring at you; this is some nice work.', '2005-04-04 17:49:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1270817, 158636, 14773, '<td valign="top">Has a great "awe" factor. Not normally a fan of neat image, but the way you weave the colors and textures like paint is nothing short of pleasing.  Your acute attention to contrast and color is again spectacular. Fantastic composition and styling, I give this two cold/clammy thumbs up :-)<br/></td>', 'Has a great "awe" factor. Not normally a fan of neat image, but the way you weave the colors and textures like paint is nothing short of pleasing.  Your acute attention to contrast and color is again spectacular. Fantastic composition and styling, I give this two cold/clammy thumbs up :-)', '2005-04-04 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1270875, 160437, 32997, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the set-up assumption...really nice shot, even better knowing you found it this way!</td>', 'Sorry about the set-up assumption...really nice shot, even better knowing you found it this way!', '2005-04-04 18:54:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1270879, 160555, 32997, '<td valign="top">Just wanted you to know I had this shot in my top 10. Love the mood!</td>', 'Just wanted you to know I had this shot in my top 10. Love the mood!', '2005-04-04 18:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1270891, 160544, 32997, '<td valign="top">I think you have succeeded despite the numbers. Maybe you made people think..don''t learn the lesson please..realize that some people need you to see the world through their eyes, otherwise you are "wasting " their time. I appreciate what you have done here.<br/>My six year old says " It makes me sad..all these trees..they were living". Need I say more?</td>', 'I think you have succeeded despite the numbers. Maybe you made people think..don''t learn the lesson please..realize that some people need you to see the world through their eyes, otherwise you are "wasting " their time. I appreciate what you have done here.My six year old says " It makes me sad..all these trees..they were living". Need I say more?', '2005-04-04 19:04:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1270911, 158636, 8860, '<td valign="top">Why shouldn''t a gaveyard be full of people jumping around, models posing, photographers clicking? If religion''s anything to do with this then there''s no worry because the spirits that occupied these deceased persons under the stones have long since fled to Heaven or Hell!<br/> <br/>Apart from that, as long as no damage is done, it''s really quite harmless. Graveyards use a lot of land - why not make more use of them?</td>', 'Why shouldn''t a gaveyard be full of people jumping around, models posing, photographers clicking? If religion''s anything to do with this then there''s no worry because the spirits that occupied these deceased persons under the stones have long since fled to Heaven or Hell! Apart from that, as long as no damage is done, it''s really quite harmless. Graveyards use a lot of land - why not make more use of them?', '2005-04-04 19:13:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1271239, 159907, 35019, '<td valign="top">Should have gone higher. Awesomely scary shot.</td>', 'Should have gone higher. Awesomely scary shot.', '2005-04-04 22:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
