(1271494, 158801, 6306, '<td valign="top">Incredible. I don''t know how you did it, but the light you captured here is amazing. I edited your original file, and I agree, the processing you did here is minimal.  Added to favorites.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-05 23:04:45.</i></td>', 'Incredible. I don''t know how you did it, but the light you captured here is amazing. I edited your original file, and I agree, the processing you did here is minimal.  Added to favorites.', '2005-04-05 00:05:15.000000', '2005-04-06 00:04:45.000000', 0),
(1271497, 158728, 6306, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.  In a photography world of burning and dodging and over-manipulation, this is a great example of how to do things naturally.  Great job. Should have been in the top 3</td>', 'This is excellent.  In a photography world of burning and dodging and over-manipulation, this is a great example of how to do things naturally.  Great job. Should have been in the top 3', '2005-04-05 00:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
