(1271943, 158801, 13547, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote on this picture, but rest assured I''d have given it an 11 if that were possible!  Fantastic!  I love the halo around the stone too, how did you do that?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-05 06:20:01.</i></td>', 'I didn''t get to vote on this picture, but rest assured I''d have given it an 11 if that were possible!  Fantastic!  I love the halo around the stone too, how did you do that?', '2005-04-05 07:19:11.000000', '2005-04-05 07:20:01.000000', 0),
