(1272114, 159229, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and now that I think about it ... it does look a bit like a good show I watch ...''Six Feet Under'' from the first Season. Anyway, guess it pays to scope out a location and come back when required. OK... I''m off to my Douge and Burn training ;-)<br/> <br/>Excellent work.</td>', 'Nicely done and now that I think about it ... it does look a bit like a good show I watch ...''Six Feet Under'' from the first Season. Anyway, guess it pays to scope out a location and come back when required. OK... I''m off to my Douge and Burn training ;-) Excellent work.', '2005-04-05 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
