(1280808, 159798, 34880, '<td valign="top">I may be off base, but I think that all 3 are the photog, and his card playing is commentary on death. I liked it.</td>', 'I may be off base, but I think that all 3 are the photog, and his card playing is commentary on death. I liked it.', '2005-04-09 14:00:46.000000', NULL, 0),
