(1377408, 159303, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Imagineer:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nicely done. This has a [Japanese version] ''The Ring'' vibe to it - moody and haunting. Composition is too tight at the bottom though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL I had to crop it that tight cos she was wearing NIKE trainers.. kinda took the STING outta the shot...lmao. But I agree with you for sure.</td>', 'Originally posted by Imagineer: Very nicely done. This has a [Japanese version] ''The Ring'' vibe to it - moody and haunting. Composition is too tight at the bottom though.   LOL I had to crop it that tight cos she was wearing NIKE trainers.. kinda took the STING outta the shot...lmao. But I agree with you for sure.', '2005-05-11 05:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
