(1422744, 159919, 38464, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. The spot by your foot is a little distracting, but reading your comments, fully understand it! Been there, done that! ;)<br/> <br/>What really struck me though, is when looking at this image, my first thought was, how the heck did she get Lorena McKennitt to pose for her! <br/> <br/><a href="//www.quinlanroad.com/explorethemusic/thevisit.asp" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lorena McKennitt - The Visit</a></td>', 'This is a beautiful image. The spot by your foot is a little distracting, but reading your comments, fully understand it! Been there, done that! ;) What really struck me though, is when looking at this image, my first thought was, how the heck did she get Lorena McKennitt to pose for her!  Lorena McKennitt - The Visit', '2005-05-31 10:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
