(1518907, 160474, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simply fantastic.  I can''t believe you didn''t get all 10''s on this one.  The expertise with manipulation truly shows here! WELL DONE.</td>', 'Simply fantastic.  I can''t believe you didn''t get all 10''s on this one.  The expertise with manipulation truly shows here! WELL DONE.', '2005-07-08 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
