(1628746, 159919, 21072, '<td valign="top">Was trying to find another pic without comments, but this one stood out too much.  The desat/out of focus background really emphasises what (I think) you were trying to do, the faded tombstones symbolise faded memories and how sometimes they can all blur together, or even fade into the background.  It is the person that is in the here and now, she is not faded and is not forgotten.  Great work.</td>', 'Was trying to find another pic without comments, but this one stood out too much.  The desat/out of focus background really emphasises what (I think) you were trying to do, the faded tombstones symbolise faded memories and how sometimes they can all blur together, or even fade into the background.  It is the person that is in the here and now, she is not faded and is not forgotten.  Great work.', '2005-08-21 20:19:25.000000', NULL, 0),
