(1992629, 159595, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective in this shot and the sky is killer (no pun intended).  Congrats on your 16th place finish!  The only thing that seems a little off to me in this shot is that the foreground and trees all seem to be a little paler/washed out compared to the deep tones of the monument and sky.  It''s probably an artistic choice you made during processing to emphasize the two (and it was obviously effective), but I just noticed a difference.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Love the perspective in this shot and the sky is killer (no pun intended).  Congrats on your 16th place finish!  The only thing that seems a little off to me in this shot is that the foreground and trees all seem to be a little paler/washed out compared to the deep tones of the monument and sky.  It''s probably an artistic choice you made during processing to emphasize the two (and it was obviously effective), but I just noticed a difference.  Very nice work.', '2006-01-01 15:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
