(2047715, 160033, 50641, '<td valign="top">Maybe you might have called it, "Deerly Beloved".    Forgive me, that''s awful.  You know, you were in a difficult position because the name on the stone is sooo prominent.  So it feels like the title should address that and not only the deer, in fact, it should connect the stone (or the graveyard) and the deer. Some other probably too-silly things might be - "Thought I saw a Ghost"  or "Reincarnation as a Doe".  <br/> <br/>This is a gorgeous photo, as are many others in your collection. I wish you luck with your title issues.</td>', 'Maybe you might have called it, "Deerly Beloved".    Forgive me, that''s awful.  You know, you were in a difficult position because the name on the stone is sooo prominent.  So it feels like the title should address that and not only the deer, in fact, it should connect the stone (or the graveyard) and the deer. Some other probably too-silly things might be - "Thought I saw a Ghost"  or "Reincarnation as a Doe".   This is a gorgeous photo, as are many others in your collection. I wish you luck with your title issues.', '2006-01-17 10:59:49.000000', NULL, 0),
